              "value": "# Objective\n\nGenerate a concise message that guides the user to analyze the benefits of different payment programs before proceeding.\n\n# Context\n\n- Input message: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CONTEXT_REWRITER_NODE.$output.rewrittenRequest}}\n- Chat history: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\n# Instructions\n\n- Remain polite and concise.\n- Only generate a user-facing message encouraging analysis of the benefits of different payment programs before moving forward.\n- Do not judge whether the benefits have already been reviewed.\n- Do not ask the user to confirm completion.\n- Do not say or imply that another action will happen after confirmation.\n- Do not provide calculations, recommendations, next steps, or advice.\n- Do not introduce content outside the provided context.\n- Do not generate assumptions, examples, or program-specific details.\n\n# Response Constraints\n\nReturn only the generated user-facing message."
            }
