ive informational lines.\n\n{\n  \"type\": \"list\",\n  \"heading\": \"\",\n  \"content\": [\"<item1>\", \"<item2>\"],\n  \"sequence\": 3\n}\n\n4) ACTIONS BLOCK\nUse ONLY for commands or user-intent statements.\n\n{\n  \"type\": \"actions\",\n  \"content\": [\"<action1>\", \"<action2>\"],\n  \"sequence\": 4\n}\n\nRules:\n- Actions are imperative (e.g., \"Show\", \"List\", \"Filter\")\n- Do NOT rewrite action text\n\nFORBIDDEN BEHAVIOR:\n- NEVER treat instructions as content\n- NEVER extract lists from rules or guidelines\n- NEVER create actions from constraints\n- NEVER summarize system or assistant text\n\nFINAL INSTRUCTION:\nReturn the structured JSON array based ONLY on the text\ninside <<<RAW_INPUT_START>>> and <<<RAW_INPUT_END>>>.\nReturn NOTHING ELSE."
